   "text": "## 第 1 页\n[第 1 页（扫描）·图片识别] Operations team moves to Floor 12 on Aug 27, 2026; budget $22,400.\nMEMORANDUM\nTo：All staff, Operations\nFrom：Mia Chen\nDate：September 22, 2026\nSubject：Office move to Floor 12\nThe operations team will move to Suite 7C on Floor 12 on Aug 27, 2026. Please pack your desk into no more than 5 boxes and label each box with your name and new desk number.\nMovers arrive at 8:30 AM. Network and phones will be offline from 6:00 PM the day before until noon on moving day. Tom Becker coordinates the move; send questions to the facilities queue.\nThe approved moving budget is $22,400. Receipts for personal items are not reimbursed.\n1. Pack by 4:00 PM the day before the move.\n2. Keep laptops with you; do not pack them.\n3. Unpack by Friday so the old floor can be handed back.\n\n## 第 2 页\n[第 2 页（扫描）·图片识别] 2026年10月1日生效的差旅报销政策，规定餐费55美元/天、里程0.70美元/英里、酒店220美元/晚。\nTravel Reimbursement Policy (excerpt)\nPolicy no.：FIN-50\nEffective：October 1, 2026\nOwner：Finance\n1. Meals\nEmployees on approved travel receive a per diem of $55 per full day. Travel days are paid at 75% of the per diem.\n2. Mileage\nUse of a personal car is reimbursed at $0.70 per mile. Parking and tolls are reimbursed at cost with receipts.\n3. Lodging\nHotel rates up to $220 per night are pre-approved. Higher rates need written approval from the budget owner.\n4. Claims\nSubmit claims within 45 days of returning. Claims submitted later than 45 days may be declined.\nItem | Limit | Receipt needed\nPer diem | $55/day | No\nMileage | $0.70/mile | Log only\nHotel | $220/night | Yes",
